DATA ATTRIBUTION
----------------
The contents of csv_data/ are derived from the OpenFlights database:

    OpenFlights — https://openflights.org
    Source files: https://github.com/jpatokal/openflights

OpenFlights airport, airline and route data is made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL):

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

Modifications made to the original dataset:
  - Routes with one or more stops were removed (11 of 67,663 rows)
  - Per-airline duplicate routes were collapsed to one row per airport pair
  - Great-circle distances were computed from coordinates using the
    haversine formula and added as distance_km
  - Airports without a valid three-letter IATA code or coordinates were removed
  - Blank and whitespace-only country values were normalised to NULL

Under ODbL, any public use of this data or derivatives of it must credit
OpenFlights and share adapted databases under the same licence.
